# Spec §6.1 (the «Hice la mínima» button), with §4.1 (Minimal version and Steps), §4.4
# (`fueMinima`), §5.4, §5.5 and §7. «Hice la mínima» completes the task like the
# checkbox, but the completion stores that it was the minimal one (`fueMinima`): the
# status and the list treat it like any other completion. The notice adds
# « · mínima». On a task with two or more steps it stores `pasoAlCompletar` and
# `pasoActual` goes back to step 1, at any step. A completion of the minimal one is
# deleted like any other, and that it was the minimal one is fixed on completion: neither
# editing or emptying the task's minimal version nor anything else changes it.
# "I tap Hice la mínima on T" is the button of the row of the only task of the
# scenario (or of the named task). The "with the minimal one" Givens leave a
# completion already stored, which opens no notice. "the last completion of the task
# was the minimal one / was whole" looks at the completion with the most recent completadoEn.
# The notice is opened by a tap on this device and is shown while
# completadoEn <= now < completadoEn + 5 seconds.
# Reference week: Friday 2026-11-13.
Feature: Hice la mínima

  # Hice la mínima 1
  # On a one-off it adds a completion that was the minimal one and the task ends up
  # completed.
  Scenario Outline: Hice la mínima 1
    Given a one-off task without a due date
    And the minimal version of the task is <minimal>
    When I tap Hice la mínima on <tap>
    Then the task is completed
    And the recorded completion is from <tap_stored>
    And the last completion of the task was the minimal one

    Examples:
      | minimal         | tap                 | tap_stored          |
      | Solo el inodoro | 2026-11-13T10:00:00 | 2026-11-13T10:00:00 |

  # Hice la mínima 2
  # On a relative it restarts the interval from the tap: it ends up waiting, with
  # the progress of a whole completion.
  Scenario Outline: Hice la mínima 2
    Given a relative recurring task every <every> <unit>
    And the minimal version of the task is <minimal>
    When I tap Hice la mínima on <tap>
    And I query the status on <now>
    Then the status is en espera
    And the progress is <progress>

    Examples:
      | every | unit   | minimal           | tap                 | now                 | progress |
      | 4    | horas  | Solo los helechos | 2026-11-13T10:00:00 | 2026-11-13T12:00:00 | 0.5      |

